Build coherent documentation websites for polyglot software projects.

Usage: polydoc <COMMAND>

Commands:
  build  Build a static documentation site
  check  Check documentation without writing a site
  serve  Build and serve a site, rebuilding when declared inputs change
  help   Print this message or the help of the given subcommand(s)

Options:
  -h, --help     Print help
  -V, --version  Print version
